WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:07.059
Major arcana X to XIV cover turning points,
fairness, pause, endings and balance.

00:00:07.059 --> 00:00:12.195
Here is what each tarot card traditionally
means, upright and reversed.

00:00:13.495 --> 00:00:14.855
The Wheel of Fortune.

00:00:14.855 --> 00:00:21.657
The RWS card shows a large wheel in the sky, with a sphinx
on top and four winged figures in the corners.

00:00:22.957 --> 00:00:23.507
Justice.

00:00:23.507 --> 00:00:28.527
A seated figure holds scales in one hand
and a raised sword in the other.

00:00:28.527 --> 00:00:31.966
Fairness, truth, cause and effect,
accountability.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.747
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:35.747 --> 00:00:40.576
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
